Subject: [PATCH] swaynag: place the details toggle left of the dismiss button

For swayfx 0.6 (based on sway 1.12.0).
swaynag appends the Instructions/details toggle after the dismiss button, so it
is drawn leftmost. Insert it at index 1 so it sits directly left of Cancel, which
stays the rightmost element.

Built and rendered headless: Instructions and Cancel share one right-hand group.

---
 swaynag/main.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/swaynag/main.c b/swaynag/main.c
--- a/swaynag/main.c
+++ b/swaynag/main.c
@@ -87,7 +87,8 @@
 		swaynag.details.button_details = calloc(1, sizeof(struct swaynag_button));
 		swaynag.details.button_details->text = strdup(swaynag.details.details_text);
 		swaynag.details.button_details->type = SWAYNAG_ACTION_EXPAND;
-		list_add(swaynag.buttons, swaynag.details.button_details);
+		// Index 0 is the dismiss button, drawn rightmost; index 1 puts the toggle directly left of it.
+		list_insert(swaynag.buttons, 1, swaynag.details.button_details);
 	}
 
 	sway_log(SWAY_DEBUG, "Output: %s", swaynag.type->output);
